Clay renames GIMP's plug-in interface: libgimp is libclay, PDB procedures
are clay-*, the Gimp-3.0 introspection namespace is Clay-3.0 and the
pkg-config files are clay-3.0 (with a gimp-3.0 compatibility file for one
release). GIMP plug-ins and
scripts need these new names to run in Clay.
